{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "zs2yd5a0vsh1fc03", "title": "什么是索引", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><ul list=\"ucbf1c5cb\"><li fid=\"udca195ca\" data-lake-id=\"u1994fad7\" id=\"u1994fad7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u99c795f0\" id=\"u99c795f0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\">索引是高效获取数据的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf95192dc\" id=\"uf95192dc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\">排好序</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4ef18a1c\" id=\"u4ef18a1c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\">的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uce897308\" id=\"uce897308\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\">数据结构</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u04feea18\" id=\"u04feea18\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\">，</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue8e6fcf9\" id=\"ue8e6fcf9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">通过在某些列上创建索引，数据库可以更高效地查找、检索和排序数据；</span></li><li fid=\"udca195ca\" data-lake-id=\"u0278c63a\" id=\"u0278c63a\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2dbff2de\" id=\"u2dbff2de\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">提高查询速度：索引用于快速查找特定行，特别是在大型数据表中，索引可以大大减少扫描的行数，从而加快查询速度。</span></li><li fid=\"udca195ca\" data-lake-id=\"u048b4c66\" id=\"u048b4c66\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc48d6000\" id=\"uc48d6000\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">排序和分组：通过索引，数据库可以更快地进行 ORDER BY 和 GROUP BY 操作。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"i7vHJ\" id=\"i7vHJ\"><span data-lake-id=\"u509765f2\" id=\"u509765f2\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">1. 创建用户表</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CREATE%20TABLE%20users%20(%5Cn%20%20id%20INT%20AUTO_INCREMENT%20PRIMARY%20KEY%2C%5Cn%20%20username%20VARCHAR(50)%20NOT%20NULL%2C%5Cn%20%20email%20VARCHAR(100)%20NOT%20NULL%2C%5Cn%20%20age%20INT%5Cn)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%5CnINSERT%2