Cn('user38'%2C%20'user38%40example.com'%2C%2042)%2C%5Cn('user39'%2C%20'user39%40example.com'%2C%2043)%2C%5Cn('user40'%2C%20'user40%40example.com'%2C%2044)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3A%222%22%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JxYfZ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"S7IVW\" id=\"S7IVW\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a10abef\" id=\"u1a10abef\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">2. 添加索引</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ub7e40ec1\" id=\"ub7e40ec1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubb8d6b4a\" id=\"ubb8d6b4a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">假设我们希望在 email 字段上添加一个索引，以提高查询速度。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CREATE%20INDEX%20idx_email%20ON%20users(email)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JQbkI%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"scrhB\" id=\"scrhB\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc8158b15\" id=\"uc8158b15\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">3. 查看索引</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22SHOW%20INDEX%20FROM%20users%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tZUbZ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"zhbnE\" id=\"zhbnE\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc98d9275\" id=\"uc98d9275\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">4. 修改索引</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u9e89d68c\" id=\"u9e89d68c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub7f234f2\" id=\"ub7f234f2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u2a1d6155\" id=\"u2a1d6155\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">假设你想修改索引，比如改变索引名称或者添加一个复合索引，可以先删除现有的索引，再创建新的索引。例如，删除 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ucd65fe63\" id=\"ucd65fe63\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50f246de\" id=\"u50f246de\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">email</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u94cb6d4d\" id=\"u94cb6d4d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> 上的索引并添加一个 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u33d0b543\" id=\"u33d0b543\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue32e8336\" id=\"ue32e8336\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">email + age</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u80f8c7bd\" id=\"u80f8c7bd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-24\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> 复合索引。</span><span data-lake-id=\"u75f645e6\" id=\"u75f645e6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">  </span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22--%20%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E5%8E%9F%E6%9C%89%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%5Cn%5CnDROP%20INDEX%20idx_email%20ON%20users%3B%5Cn%5Cn--%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%8D%E5%90%88%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%5Cn%5CnCREATE%20INDEX%20idx_email_age%20ON%20users(email%2C%20age)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n4OGp%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"eGmJG\" id=\"eGmJG\"><span data-lake-id=\"uafeb7f66\" id=\"uafeb7f66\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">5. 删除索引</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22sql%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22DROP%20INDEX%20idx_email_age%20ON%20users%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dAMrz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 443, "description": "索引是高效获取数据的排好序的数据结构，通过在某些列上创建索引，数据库可以更高效地查找、检索和排序数据；提高查询速度：索引用于快速查找特定行，特别是在大型数据表中，索引可以大大减少扫描的行数，从而加快查询速度。排序和分组：通过索引，数据库可以更快地进行 ORDER BY 和 GROUP BY 操...", "updated_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:20.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:01.000Z", "id": 216261321, "status": 1}